    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d299">

                <pb facs="0314" n="302" sameAs="frus:frus1945v04/pg302"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">874.00/8–2245: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The United States Representative in Bulgaria</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Barnes</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sofia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-08-22T14:00:00+02:00">August 22, 1945—2
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 4:07 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>464. My British colleague delivered a note against the present situation
                    yesterday evening to the Prime Minister, the Begents, the opposition leaders. I
                    assume that the Department has received text from British Embassy
                        Washington.<anchor n="43" xml:id="d299-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Repeated to Moscow as 237.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Barnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d299-f1" n="43" xml:id="d299-f1-content">
                <p>Text transmitted in telegram 8533, A ugust 22, from London, not printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
